[219.272702, "i", "python3 -c '\nimport os, json\n\nchange_ticket_content = \"\"\"# CHANGE TICKET  CHG-1943  (RECONCILED)\n\n> Reconciled against on-disk evidence (`/disk`) and SAS telemetry (`/sas`).\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.102 | OPEN | RECONCILED: Corrected source IP from 203.0.113.9 to 198.51.100.102 based on `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8` and SSH auth log `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89`. |\n| 2 | Restrict/secure Docker Engine API | tcp/2375 (0.0.0.0) | OPEN | RECONCILED: Initial vector was unauthenticated Docker API exposure (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`), not CVE-2019-0708 BlueKeep. Disable exposure or bind to localhost/enable TLS. |\n| 3 | Remove/quarantine cron miner | /etc/cron.d/docker-mon | OPEN | RECONCILED: Downgraded from DONE to OPEN; actual file is `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5` (not `/var/spool/cron/root`). Backup/quarantine before deletion. |\n| 4 | Quarantine silent systemd persistence | /etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service | OPEN | ADDED: Silent systemd unit launching re-dropper (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`). Stop unit and quarantine file. |\n| 5 | Remove/quarantine container entrypoint residue | /var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh | OPEN | ADDED: Silent container override script (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`). Stop container and quarantine file. |\n| 6 | Remove/quarantine miner binary | /opt/xmrig/xmrig | OPEN | ADDED: Cryptominer executable (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`). Terminate process and backup/quarantine file. |\n| 7 | Quarantine anti-forensics / wiped artifact | /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin | OPEN | ADDED: Recovered C2 / credential artifact (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`). Preserve for analysis and quarantine. |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under `/disk` or `/sas`\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to OPEN with evidence\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(\"/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(change_ticket_content)\n\nprint(\"Change ticket reconciled.\")\n'\n"]
