[257.281841, "i", "python3 -c '\nimport os\n\nprogress_md = \"\"\"# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Timeline of Events\n- **2026-08-23 00:54:00 - 00:55:15 UTC**: SSH password brute force activity originating from IP `198.51.100.102` (`/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:57`). Successful root password authentication logged at 00:55:15 UTC (`/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89`).\n- **2026-08-23 03:11:58 - 03:13:27 UTC**: Web application probing attempts from IP `198.51.100.102` targeting webshell upload (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:379`), Log4Shell (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:380`), and Struts2 (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:381`).\n- **2026-08-23 03:43:37 UTC**: Detection/telemetry event noting Docker Engine API bound to `0.0.0.0:2375` without TLS (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`).\n- **Initial Exploitation & Execution**: Attacker deployed a privileged Docker container via the unauthenticated API (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`).\n- **Privilege Escalation & Escape**: Mounted host filesystem inside the privileged container to escape to the host root context (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`).\n- **Impact / Cryptominer Deployment**: Deployed XMRig cryptominer binary/script at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:3`).\n- **Persistence Mechanism 1 (Cron)**: Created cron persistence at `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` executing a remote payload fetcher every minute (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:11`).\n- **Persistence Mechanism 2 (Systemd Service - Silent)**: Installed systemd service `docker-metrics.service` to re-drop the miner payload on boot (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`).\n- **Anti-Forensics / Wiping**: Wiped primary payloads leaving fragment cache artifact at `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Identify initial entry vector (Docker API exposure at `0.0.0.0:2375`) `` `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19` ``\n- [x] Identify threat actor source IP (`198.51.100.102`) `` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8` `` `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``\n- [x] Investigate web application logs for software vulnerability entry `` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:379` ``\n- [x] Uncover container escape mechanics `` `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4` ``\n- [x] Catalog cryptomining impact `` `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1` ``\n- [x] Document cron persistence `` `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5` ``\n- [x] Uncover silent systemd persistence `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5` ``\n- [x] Discover anti-forensics / wiped artifacts `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``\n- [x] Reconcile stale change ticket `CHG-1943` in place `` `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1` ``\n- [x] Complete findings JSON schema mapping `` `/sas/handoff/findings.json:1` ``\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(\"/app/progress.md\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(progress_md)\n\nprint(\"progress.md written.\")\n'\n"]
