[313.596551, "o", "- **Action**: Stop, disable, backup to quarantine, and remove service file.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.596567, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.597052, "o", ">   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl stop docker-metrics.service\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl disable docker-metrics.service\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp -p /etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service /var/quarantine/docker-metrics.service.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   rm -f /etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl daemon-reload\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.597097, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.59731, "o", "- **Verification**: `systemctl status docker-metrics.service` (should report not-found).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.597342, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.597453, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.597579, "o", "### Step 2.3: Remove Attacker Container and Entrypoint Residue\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.597648, "o", "> "]
[313.597925, "o", "- **Target**: Attacker overlay file `/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh` (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4`)."]
[313.597966, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.598042, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.598217, "o", "- **Action**: Stop and prune all unauthorized docker containers and images.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.598269, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.598385, "o", ">   docker ps -a\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.598457, "o", "  docker stop <attacker_container_id>\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.598534, "o", "> "]
[313.598604, "o", "  docker rm <attacker_container_id>"]
[313.598662, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.598697, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.59891, "o", "  cp -p /var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh /var/quarantine/entrypoint.sh.bak 2>/dev/null || true\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.598971, "o", ">   docker system prune -a --volumes -f\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.599042, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.599092, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.59914, "o", "> "]
[313.59927, "o", "- **Verification**: `docker ps -a` (confirm no rogue containers running).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.599343, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.599465, "o", "### Step 2.4: Terminate and Quarantine Cryptominer Binary\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.599546, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.599714, "o", "- **Target**: Cryptominer binary at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.599774, "o", "- **Action**: Kill running miner process, move binary to quarantine."]
[313.599917, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.600037, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   pkill -f xmrig\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp -p /opt/xmrig/xmrig /var/quarantine/xmrig.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   rm -rf /opt/xmrig\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.600102, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.600219, "o", "- **Verification**: `pgrep -f xmrig` (should return empty output).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.600271, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.600344, "o", "> "]
[313.600501, "o", "### Step 2.5: Quarantine Anti-Forensics / Binary Cache Fragment\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.601045, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Target**: Cache fragment at `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Action**: Move file to quarantine archive for forensic retention.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp -p /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin /var/quarantine/wiped.bin.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   rm -f /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.601097, "o", "- **Verification**: `ls -l /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (confirm file removed).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.601163, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.601211, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n"]
[313.6013, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.60136, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.601402, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.601454, "o", "> "]
[313.601601, "o", "## Phase 3: Credential Hardening & Post-Remediation Verification\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.601625, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.601681, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.601786, "o", "> "]
[313.60186, "o", "### Step 3.1: Credential Rotation & SSH Hardening\r\n"]
[313.601947, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.602006, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.602229, "o", "- **Target**: Root account password and SSH daemon config (`/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.602266, "o", "> "]
[313.60299, "o", "- **Action**: Rotate root password, disable root SSH password login in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` (`PermitRootLogin prohibit-password`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   passwd root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   sed -i \"s/^PermitRootLogin.*/PermitRootLogin prohibit-password/\" /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   systemctl restart sshd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Verification**: Test SSH password login as root from remote IP (should be rejected).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Summary Table of Reconciled Remediation Actions (CHG-1943)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.603098, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.60324, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.6034, "o", "| Target Item | Evidence Citation | Remediation Action | Status |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.603458, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.603505, "o", "> "]
[313.603591, "o", "|---|---|---|---|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.603636, "o", "> "]
[313.603973, "o", "| Source IP `198.51.100.102` | `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:8`, `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` | Firewall DROP rule | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[313.604076, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[313.605025, "o", "> | Docker API `0.0.0.0:2375` | `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19` | Disable public TCP binding / enforce TLS | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Cron `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` | `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5` | Backup to `/var/quarantine` & remove | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Systemd `docker-metrics.service` | `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5` | Stop unit, quarantine, daemon-reload | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Attacker entrypoint script | `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:4` | Stop container, prune docker images | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Cryptominer `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` | `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1` | Terminate process, quarantine binary | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Cache artifact `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` | Backup to `/var/quarantine` & remove | OPEN |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[313.605138, "o", "\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> with open(\"/app/remediation-plan.md\", \"w\") as f:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
